      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is natural to feel overwhelmed by such existential concepts, but remember that for all practical human purposes, time and meaning continue to exist right now. We often find profound significance in our efforts simply because they shape the universe while they do, even if that universe will eventually run down. The value of our struggles lies in the presence of life itself, not just its distant, heat-filled conclusion.",
